{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Twin Tile</i> brings you a memory challenge. You can play by yourself or against your family and friends hile you enjoy these pixel-art tiles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy our 3 game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic</strong>: up to 4 players compete to get the most amount of pairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial</strong>: challenge yourself on the 24-tile panel and try to make it as fast as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expert</strong>: looking for a real challenge? Expert mode will set you through a series of increasing-difficulty levels. But watch out! If you make a mistake, you'll have to start all over again.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00bfWould you like to create your own tiles? Visit the <strong>Workshop</strong>\u00a0and paint one by hand or uing several tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>60 different tiles</strong> await you!\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Potter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937800/fa6a0dbe9fff8d974e15e56d2598be41bf112b8c.jpg"},{"name":"Combo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937800/eb5c1bcb3dd424aaee3993d63274260d33d9afa3.jpg"},{"name":"Battuta","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937800/022be86fb046dbc4d876673263479a9f79400119.jpg"},{"name":"Erudite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937800/c31f21a09220e9b3983493c93094efcc63d4ba73.jpg"},{"name":"Speedy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937800/01fdafe8d7cccef7b3c37e891f1c4c736cd28e00.jpg"},{"name":"Twinning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3937800/c17636fce76602c1280b967867db3121134a7205.